"\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAround autumn in October 2026, here is Baden-Württemberg Ettlingen Big Flower Postcard.  \n\nTotoro holding an umbrella fills the wall, sparkling with blue triangles.  \n\nIt has a sharp kind of cuteness, distinct from the fluffy feel of the original work. From the bottom corner, a Pikmin holding a flower looks up at Totoro. It’s a postcard that would be even more delightful to come across in an alley on a rainy day.  \n\n\n\n\n"